NODE id=matrix/neo/cmd/neo.newSlotClient kind=func
  digest=b3:9a7e7f75dde067ff2a89217570de65626b4b12283c6181f1d94da084f7ac10a5 file=neo/cmd/neo/main.go range=197:215 lang=go exported=false byte_range=5208:6182
  sig=func newSlotClient(model string, temp float64, maxTok int, slot string, enableThinking bool, cfg config.Config) (*neollm.Client, error)
  doc=newSlotClient builds a gateway-metered chat client tagged with the given\nslot label, so spend is attributed correctly (Neo's own "neo" slot, or\nCassandra's dedicated "cassandra" slot for completeness audits). enableThinking\nopts the client into extended reasoning where the toggle matters (xAI Grok's\nreasoning_effort control; Baseten Kimi's chat_template_args opt-in) — set ONLY\nfor the user-facing conversational loop (Neo).\nCassandra, background sub-agents, and the token-tight cheap/consolidation\nroles all run with thinking OFF; the core MCL pipeline manages its own.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/cmd/neo/main.go

